Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.99,0:00:42.24,GXZ95,,0,0,0,,{\fs22.5}{\i1}I gaze at the sky where tomorrow should arrive,\NMy heart, lost and wandering, can’t decide its stride{\i0}{\i0}
